WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,730 --> 00:00:06,810
Okay, son

2
00:00:06,810 --> 00:00:08,530
I only downloaded thirty Earth Dragon Nets in total.

3
00:00:08,530 --> 00:00:11,610
You can get so many good things, mother, take Yaqin and the others with you

4
00:00:11,610 --> 00:00:13,650
Get rid of these fish marks as soon as possible. Remember

5
00:00:13,650 --> 00:00:16,330
After opening, clean the veins on top and dry them

6
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:17,930
Must be placed in a ventilated and cool place

7
00:00:17,930 --> 00:00:18,930
Never be exposed to the sun

8
00:00:22,610 --> 00:00:24,170
I still use you to pay for it

9
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:25,770
Your mother and I have lived by the sea all our lives

10
00:00:25,770 --> 00:00:26,890
Do you still know this?

11
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:36,680
We steamed these miscellaneous fish and shrimps

12
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:39,320
Is it okay to boil it in water and eat it with dipping sauce?

13
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:41,400
Why do we eat it every day if it’s either steamed or boiled?

14
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:43,400
There's a bird in my mouth, can't I?

15
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:44,640
I want to eat fried small fish

16
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:46,440
Those Pipi shrimps are made into glutinous salt Pipi shrimps

17
00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:47,880
Eating like this will attract cicadas

18
00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:48,880
That oil is so valuable

19
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:50,320
Our family just got a loan of more than 8,000 yuan

20
00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:51,520
I need to save on food and consumption in the future.

21
00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:52,880
You also know that we owe more than eight thousand

22
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:53,880
Not eighty yuan

23
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:55,360
How much money can I pay back this note from between my teeth?

24
00:00:55,360 --> 00:00:57,040
You have to listen to me in the Year of the Monkey and the Horse.

25
00:00:57,040 --> 00:00:58,160
Eat and drink when you should

26
00:00:58,160 --> 00:00:59,280
With your man’s efficiency in making money

27
00:00:59,280 --> 00:01:00,880
I don’t have to rely on you to save money on three meals a day.

28
00:01:01,650 --> 00:01:03,490
Who are you? This man is so shameless.

29
00:01:03,490 --> 00:01:15,900
Too lazy to use force

30
00:01:15,900 --> 00:01:16,980
Have you seen it? Song Yuan

31
00:01:16,980 --> 00:01:18,580
Women are so duplicitous

32
00:01:18,580 --> 00:01:19,620
Swearing loudly

33
00:01:19,660 --> 00:01:22,300
In fact, your little ID always feels sorry for me, do you believe it or not?

34
00:01:22,300 --> 00:01:24,140
I'm sure I'll be able to eat fried fish tonight

35
00:01:24,140 --> 00:01:26,700
I don’t believe it with the glue, salt and shrimp
